«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  PhitAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 1; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 1 ≠ THEN "PhitAll: needs 1 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Xv « Xv 0 + → X « '0.5*(1+erf(X/√(2)))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'EXP(-(X^2)/2)/√(2*Ⓒπ)' →Num "PDF" →Tag '0.5*erfc(X/√(2))' →Num "CDFc" →Tag '0' →Num "μ" →Tag '1' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE Xv 1 →List Drop » »
»
